{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Exot",
    "steam_appid": 3326000,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After long years of labor, Maurice was finally able to treat himself to the cruise of his dreams. A brand new concept, which promises great thrills as you approach a mysterious region of the universe: the Exot galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following the incompetence of the crew on board, our hero finds himself stranded with his escape pod on an unknown planet, with no hope of leaving...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C.L.I.C., YOUR BEST FRIEND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The manufacturers of your Compact Loyal Integrated Console (C.L.I.C.) have locked certain features: unlock them to access new resources and improve its performance to be able survive in the Exot galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOUR SHIP, A CUSTOMIZED BASE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin your adventure in an escape pod: you will be safe there, even it is not fully functional. Transform it into a truly tailor-made base by adding new rooms, grow rooms, etc. Convert it into a ship by adding engines and anti-G systems, and take off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE GALAXY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each planet in the Exot galaxy contains specific resources that you will need to progress. To achieve this, several paths are available to you: some are easy, others will challenge you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVOLVING WORKSHOPS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workshops will allow you to craft many items and resources: feed them with fuel, automate them, improve their performance and try to unlock all the available recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE ENCOUNTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Domesticate the local fauna, do business with merchants, confront various hostile entities to try to find a place for yourself in this little-known galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE MASTER OF THE PLACE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your first trip into Hyperspace, you risk having an astonishing encounter. A legendary entity awaits you there: the Catgo. It will test you through a series of quests to complete. The rewards you earn will open new doors for you\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival : survive the hostile environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolution : unlock new skills and features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base Building : customize and expand your base as you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Exploration : equip your ship to travel the galaxy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting : build the workshops and resources necessary for your survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming : breed animals and cultivate the local flora</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining : search for the most precious minerals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat : face the hostile creatures\u00a0that roam its lands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests : complete the quests assigned by the Chargot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable game difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative mode available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configurable Game Options : display, quality, controls, fonts, colors, etc.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After long years of labor, Maurice was finally able to treat himself to the cruise of his dreams. A brand new concept, which promises great thrills as you approach a mysterious region of the universe: the Exot galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following the incompetence of the crew on board, our hero finds himself stranded with his escape pod on an unknown planet, with no hope of leaving...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C.L.I.C., YOUR BEST FRIEND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The manufacturers of your Compact Loyal Integrated Console (C.L.I.C.) have locked certain features: unlock them to access new resources and improve its performance to be able survive in the Exot galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOUR SHIP, A CUSTOMIZED BASE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin your adventure in an escape pod: you will be safe there, even it is not fully functional. Transform it into a truly tailor-made base by adding new rooms, grow rooms, etc. Convert it into a ship by adding engines and anti-G systems, and take off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE GALAXY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each planet in the Exot galaxy contains specific resources that you will need to progress. To achieve this, several paths are available to you: some are easy, others will challenge you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVOLVING WORKSHOPS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workshops will allow you to craft many items and resources: feed them with fuel, automate them, improve their performance and try to unlock all the available recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE ENCOUNTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Domesticate the local fauna, do business with merchants, confront various hostile entities to try to find a place for yourself in this little-known galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE MASTER OF THE PLACE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your first trip into Hyperspace, you risk having an astonishing encounter. A legendary entity awaits you there: the Catgo. It will test you through a series of quests to complete. The rewards you earn will open new doors for you\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival : survive the hostile environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolution : unlock new skills and features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base Building : customize and expand your base as you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Exploration : equip your ship to travel the galaxy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting : build the workshops and resources necessary for your survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming : breed animals and cultivate the local flora</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining : search for the most precious minerals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat : face the hostile creatures\u00a0that roam its lands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests : complete the quests assigned by the Chargot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable game difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative mode available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configurable Game Options : display, quality, controls, fonts, colors, etc.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Discover a still unexplored region of space: the Exot galaxy. With your C.L.I.C. as your only ally, obtain the resources necessary for your survival. Develop your ship, improve your workshops, face creatures to conquer these hostile lands.",
